{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To determine how many positive even perfect cubes are less than 2008, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Identify the general form of an even perfect cube.\n2. Determine the range of even integers whose cubes are less than 2008.\n3. Count the number of such integers.\n\nAn even perfect cube can be written as \\((2k)^3 = 8k^3\\) where \\(k\\) is a positive integer. We need to find the largest integer \\(k\\) such that \\(8k^3 < 2008\\).\n\nFirst, we solve the inequality \\(8k^3 < 2008\\):\n\n\\[\nk^3 < \\frac{2008}{8} = 251\n\\]\n\nNext, we find the integer part of the cube root of 251:\n\n","prefix_end":569,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,8253,1246,1657,6785,1496,4727,54104,525,2686,1091,220,17,15,15,23,11,582,1184,311,1795,1493,7354,1447,16,13,64547,279,4586,1352,315,458,1496,4727,23739,624,17,13,29901,279,2088,315,1496,25780,6693,54104,525,2686,1091,220,17,15,15,23,624,18,13,4504,279,1372,315,1741,25780,382,2082,1496,4727,23739,646,387,5326,438,1124,1188,17,74,29776,18,284,220,23,74,61,18,57758,1380,17767,74,57758,374,264,6785,7546,13,1205,1184,311,1477,279,7772,7546,17767,74,57758,1741,429,17767,23,74,61,18,366,220,17,15,15,23,59,3593,5338,11,582,11625,279,31205,17767,23,74,61,18,366,220,17,15,15,23,59,7731,59,9640,74,61,18,366,1124,37018,90,17,15,15,23,15170,23,92,284,220,17,20,16,198,59,2533,5847,11,582,1477,279,7546,949,315,279,23739,3704,315,220,17,20,16,1447,59,9640,74,366,1124,26888,58,18,15370,17,20,16,532,59,2533,16429,264,29952,11,582,1477,429,1124,11520,26888,58,18,15370,17,20,16,92,1124,48053,220,21,13,18,16,59,568,15277,11,279,7772,7546,17767,74,57758,374,220,21,13,1096,3363,17767,74,57758,646,387,894,7546,504,220,16,311,220,21,13,6771,594,1140,1493,2750,1447,59,9640,74,284,220,16,11,220,17,11,220,18,11,220,19,11,220,20,11,220,21,198,59,2533,7039,11,582,11047,279,12159,54104,1447,59,9640